COMMERCIAL LEASE AGREEMENT
Unit 4B, 123 High Street

CLAUSE 23: SERVICE CHARGE EXCLUSIONS

23.1 The Tenant shall NOT be responsible for contributing to the Service Charge
     in respect of any costs incurred by the Landlord for:

    (a) The initial construction or design of the Building;

    (b) Any works regarding the structural integrity or external envelope,
        specifically including:
        (i)   Foundations and load-bearing walls;
        (ii)  Roof replacement or structural roof repairs;
        (iii) EXTERNAL FACADE CLEANING, maintenance, or repair of the
              external envelope including glazing and cladding;

    (c) Any costs recoverable by the Landlord from insurance policies;

    (d) Any costs arising from the Landlord's negligence.
